WEBVTT

01:42.122 --> 01:43.499
The Basilisk's down!

01:43.582 --> 01:45.751
What's he got equipped?!
This wasn't in the brief!

01:45.835 --> 01:47.253
The fixer fed us false info!

01:47.336 --> 01:49.755
-We're done for…
-Call for back-up!

01:49.839 --> 01:51.006
He's running!

01:51.090 --> 01:52.758
He's headed for Night City.

01:52.842 --> 01:56.095
Don't let Arasaka
take back the cyberskeleton!

01:57.972 --> 01:59.473
So? Where we headed?

01:59.557 --> 02:00.516
Arasaka!

02:00.599 --> 02:02.601
Arasaka… City Center?!

02:02.685 --> 02:03.519
Yeah!

02:03.602 --> 02:05.146
Why Arasaka?!

02:05.229 --> 02:06.939
We're saving Lucy!

02:07.022 --> 02:09.233
Why's she with Arasaka?!

02:09.316 --> 02:13.821
Faraday said she's part
of his deal with them…

02:15.239 --> 02:17.158
I gotta close my eyes a bit…

02:17.241 --> 02:21.745
Again?! Shit, the meds
are wearing off faster…

02:23.038 --> 02:25.249
We've got some Militech company.

02:25.332 --> 02:27.918
Shake them off! David's benched for five.

02:28.002 --> 02:28.961
What?!

02:29.044 --> 02:30.254
-Now?!
-Yeah.

02:30.337 --> 02:34.383
Fine. Five minutes? I'll buy him a nap.

02:38.470 --> 02:39.930
Take the front!

02:40.014 --> 02:43.017
Alrighty, let's get this show on the road!

03:02.494 --> 03:04.121
Way to go, old man!

03:07.291 --> 03:08.459
Nice going!

03:09.710 --> 03:12.212
Shit, another swarm ahead!

03:12.296 --> 03:13.547
Arasaka's up next!

03:13.631 --> 03:16.342
Okie-dokie! Barrel on through!

03:16.425 --> 03:19.303
Not against that number.
We're getting off.

03:19.386 --> 03:21.221
What?! Come on!

03:21.305 --> 03:23.724
Militech's forces are nearly gone.

03:24.308 --> 03:28.520
The target's entered Night City
and our recovery team's on him.

03:28.604 --> 03:31.190
This is going to be hell to cover up…

03:31.273 --> 03:35.736
This is what we get
for putting all our chips on a fixer…

03:35.819 --> 03:41.450
According to path calculations, there's
a 74% chance that he's headed here.

03:41.533 --> 03:43.619
Here? Why?

03:43.702 --> 03:48.540
Can't say. He shouldn't even
know that we're involved.

03:48.624 --> 03:51.335
Damn. Get in contact
with internal security.

03:51.418 --> 03:54.713
Ma'am? The higher ups will be alerted.

03:54.797 --> 03:57.883
Better to stir up a storm
and hide in the dust.

03:57.967 --> 04:01.637
Damn it, Faraday…
Nothing is going according to plan.

04:01.720 --> 04:08.143
Imagine me, a lowly street fixer, meeting
with Arasaka intel inside their own tower.

04:08.769 --> 04:11.897
It's quite the breakthrough,
wouldn't you say?

04:13.357 --> 04:17.528
All who live in this city
should aspire to climb high.

04:17.611 --> 04:20.489
This is but a stepping stone on my way up.

05:14.835 --> 05:17.338
What am I doing…

06:01.632 --> 06:02.633
End of the line!

06:02.716 --> 06:04.301
Wakey, wakey David!

06:04.885 --> 06:06.845
Don't ask where these come from.

06:06.929 --> 06:10.557
Nine times the dosage
of those military-issued meds.

06:10.641 --> 06:17.439
It'll force you to stay sane,
but the side effects'll stack.

06:17.523 --> 06:22.820
By the time ya hit the last vial…

06:23.737 --> 06:25.906
Whatever's left of ya, Davey…

06:27.407 --> 06:31.495
You'll slingshot the other way,
straight over the edge.

06:50.556 --> 06:51.682
Woo-hoo!

06:57.688 --> 07:00.816
Damn. They just keep coming!

07:15.956 --> 07:17.833
Oh shit!

07:35.476 --> 07:37.394
I want you to work hard, rise up,

07:37.478 --> 07:41.648
and get to the top floor of Arasaka Tower!

07:42.232 --> 07:44.651
I know you got it in you, Dee.

07:49.615 --> 07:50.824
Mom!

07:51.366 --> 07:57.748
Thanks, mom. I'll do it.
To the top floor of Arasaka Tower…

07:59.416 --> 08:00.834
Okay.

08:00.918 --> 08:03.295
Let's go. All the way to the top.

08:03.879 --> 08:06.924
I got special meds from Doc.

08:07.007 --> 08:10.844
If I look like I'm losing it,
I need you to shoot me up…

08:10.928 --> 08:13.555
So I can keep it together.

08:15.641 --> 08:18.727
I don't think the meds'll
work on him anymore.

08:18.810 --> 08:20.646
Seriously? What do we do?

08:20.729 --> 08:23.815
We're going to 'Saka!
There's no other option.

08:24.608 --> 08:26.443
But with David like that?

08:26.527 --> 08:27.945
We need Lucy!

08:28.028 --> 08:29.446
What?

08:29.530 --> 08:33.825
She's… the only one
that might be able to bring him back.

08:34.493 --> 08:37.079
I can't think of anyone else that could!

08:42.417 --> 08:44.962
I'm not doing any more jobs for you.

08:45.045 --> 08:46.088
I see…

08:46.922 --> 08:48.590
I understand.

08:50.676 --> 08:57.099
My contract stipulates that I get rid of
anyone who knows about the cyberskeleton.

08:57.182 --> 09:00.978
No exceptions… Not even for you.

09:02.980 --> 09:04.731
Go! After her!

09:05.524 --> 09:08.735
We're getting closer to
the Tower! What's our plan?

09:08.819 --> 09:10.988
When do we ever have a plan?!

09:12.322 --> 09:14.116
David! Do that thing again!

09:16.201 --> 09:17.953
Woo-hoo!

09:19.246 --> 09:22.624
Die! Have some of this!

09:27.754 --> 09:31.592
Persistent bastards!
Cut us a break already!

09:36.847 --> 09:37.681
We lose them?

09:37.764 --> 09:39.474
Most of 'em!

09:40.309 --> 09:42.227
MaxTac!

09:44.605 --> 09:46.106
They sent three AVs?!

09:46.189 --> 09:48.817
They flagged him as a cyberpsycho already?

09:48.900 --> 09:53.488
We're all fucked
if David doesn't get his shit together!

09:53.572 --> 09:55.407
You don't say!

09:55.490 --> 10:01.747
MaxTac was dispatched to dispose of him
as a cyberpsychosis case.

10:01.830 --> 10:03.332
What a nightmare…

10:03.415 --> 10:06.418
This has grown far beyond
our original means.

10:06.501 --> 10:11.340
The boy. We need to stop him
before he makes matters worse.

10:11.423 --> 10:13.925
It's impossible. No one can stop him.

10:14.009 --> 10:16.762
We must wait
for the implant to wear him down.

10:17.346 --> 10:19.431
There is one person who can.

10:19.514 --> 10:20.641
Who?

10:20.724 --> 10:22.392
Adam Smasher.

10:22.476 --> 10:24.436
Y-You're joking.

10:24.519 --> 10:27.939
No, though I'd rather not
have had it come to this.

10:28.023 --> 10:30.734
But even if you summon him now…

10:30.817 --> 10:32.361
That's not a problem.

10:32.861 --> 10:34.529
He's already here.

10:35.322 --> 10:40.619
The cyberskeleton
was originally designed for him.

10:40.702 --> 10:43.538
It's poetic that he should be
the one to end it.

10:43.622 --> 10:46.833
Drop out. Get gone.

10:46.917 --> 10:48.877
Afraid of getting caught?

10:48.960 --> 10:50.837
'Cause I sure ain't.

10:56.677 --> 10:59.846
Fuck you, MaxTac! Come and get us!

11:02.933 --> 11:05.310
What the hell? Hey! Shit!

11:05.394 --> 11:07.312
You're just gonna leave us here?!

11:07.396 --> 11:09.564
Mom!

11:19.199 --> 11:20.617
Is he even human?

11:20.700 --> 11:21.952
Keep shooting!

11:22.035 --> 11:24.413
Hold fire! New orders from Arasaka.

11:24.496 --> 11:26.206
Code A.S. We're retreating.

11:26.289 --> 11:27.124
What?

11:31.294 --> 11:33.880
Rebecca… How many vials are left?

11:33.964 --> 11:35.424
Just one more.

11:36.716 --> 11:38.635
Finally at the end of the rope…

11:40.929 --> 11:41.847
Kiwi?!

11:41.930 --> 11:44.891
Huh?! Two-timing bitch!
I'll fucking kill you!

12:37.152 --> 12:40.822
…Faraday's turn to be betrayed now.

12:51.917 --> 12:53.835
Kiwi has been disposed of.

12:53.919 --> 12:55.587
Nasty business…

13:04.638 --> 13:05.472
Hey!

13:10.560 --> 13:12.062
It can't be… David?!

13:21.738 --> 13:23.657
Don't stop till we reach the loading dock!

13:24.241 --> 13:28.286
Faraday will soon be
arriving with the runner.

13:28.370 --> 13:31.623
As I thought,
Martinez must be after our fixer, not us.

13:31.706 --> 13:33.750
I'll order the AV to turn around.

13:33.833 --> 13:39.005
No, keep them on course for the dock.
You'll meet them there.

13:39.506 --> 13:41.424
I'll meet them?

13:42.008 --> 13:47.305
Someone's going to have to
take the fall for all this mess,

13:47.389 --> 13:49.933
and that person is not me.

13:50.016 --> 13:51.184
Do you understand?

13:51.810 --> 13:57.232
Make sure that mangy fixer
never makes it past the loading dock.

14:00.318 --> 14:05.949
You're up against the cyberskeleton.
Think you might have some fun, Smasher?

14:06.032 --> 14:11.329
It's a child's toy
reliant on antigrav training wheels…

14:11.413 --> 14:13.331
Not even worth my time.

14:19.045 --> 14:20.088
Kill him!

14:20.171 --> 14:21.590
Fire!

14:21.673 --> 14:22.966
Where is he?!

14:23.049 --> 14:24.342
No one's there!

14:28.430 --> 14:29.431
Mom…

14:30.390 --> 14:33.810
Look, I'm at the top of Arasaka Tower.

14:35.645 --> 14:39.816
Well, this is the last one, Doc…

14:39.900 --> 14:46.531
Once you've gone off the edge,
there's no coming back.

14:47.032 --> 14:49.576
Doesn't matter how special you are.

14:49.659 --> 14:51.912
But that's why I gotta go.

14:51.995 --> 14:55.707
'Cause I've got nothing left now.

15:01.463 --> 15:05.508
Seems to me like someone
didn't follow the plan, Faraday.

15:05.592 --> 15:10.513
I brought the girl alive. I believe
our agreed price was one million?

15:10.597 --> 15:13.725
We don't deal with dogs
that run off-leash.

15:13.808 --> 15:17.771
Do you know what happens to
the ones that leave their cages?

15:17.854 --> 15:22.776
Is that a threat? Don't you need
the data inside this cranium?

15:22.859 --> 15:27.530
I can't allow you to take
a single step further in this building.

15:27.614 --> 15:30.033
I would say that's very unwise.

15:30.116 --> 15:36.039
With all the information I have,
it'd be a loss not to keep me on payroll.

15:36.122 --> 15:40.752
Leave the girl and get out.
We'll send the payment as agreed.

15:40.835 --> 15:47.092
We have no further use for you if you
can't give us data on the cyberskeleton…

15:54.724 --> 15:56.142
Lucy…

15:56.226 --> 15:57.936
David…

16:21.126 --> 16:22.335
See that?

16:22.419 --> 16:25.130
I even delivered the cyberskeleton…

16:31.511 --> 16:34.848
You aren't gonna die that easily.

16:37.183 --> 16:38.935
Adam Smasher?!

16:39.019 --> 16:40.520
Kill him!

16:40.603 --> 16:42.105
Who the fuck are you?

16:42.188 --> 16:44.941
You're a merc! Do your fucking job!

16:45.025 --> 16:47.944
My business is with the kid.

16:48.028 --> 16:49.988
Adam Smasher?

16:50.071 --> 16:54.743
So you're Adam Smasher?
Boogeyman of legend?

16:55.326 --> 17:00.457
You're packing some heavy artillery
for your size there, cyberpunk.

17:00.540 --> 17:03.501
Impressive that you're still able to talk.

17:03.585 --> 17:08.214
Likewise, choom.
Heard you went no organic, full cyborg.

17:08.298 --> 17:10.258
You still got a brain in there?

17:10.341 --> 17:12.218
You could say I'm special.

17:12.302 --> 17:14.637
Well so the fuck am I!

17:14.721 --> 17:16.514
That a joke?

17:18.683 --> 17:20.143
Trauma Team!

17:22.896 --> 17:24.397
Thank god…

17:27.358 --> 17:30.528
Can you afford to be distracted?

18:01.851 --> 18:05.063
David! David, can you hear me?

18:05.146 --> 18:06.773
It's me, Lucy!

18:07.357 --> 18:11.277
David, come back to me! Come back…

18:24.249 --> 18:25.792
Lucy…

18:27.043 --> 18:28.795
David…

18:29.754 --> 18:31.506
You installed it.

18:32.924 --> 18:36.052
I knew you would…

18:36.636 --> 18:39.514
And I knew you would die if you did.

18:39.597 --> 18:44.936
I didn't want any of this.
Didn't want you to die…

18:45.520 --> 18:51.317
This is the only way I could
protect you from this city.

18:51.401 --> 18:54.362
I couldn't save mom or Maine,

18:54.445 --> 18:57.198
but I wanted to save you.

18:59.784 --> 19:06.708
But you never had to save me.
All I ever wanted was for you to live.

19:06.791 --> 19:11.421
I don't matter.
I don't have anything left.

19:11.504 --> 19:17.135
You have a dream.
I need you to see it through for me.

19:17.218 --> 19:21.472
That's my dream.
Everything else doesn't matter.

19:45.663 --> 19:48.750
When do you think
those Ara-suckers will give up?

19:48.833 --> 19:52.545
NCPD's out there with them.
It's not gonna be for a while.

19:52.629 --> 19:54.797
Man, I'm almost out of ammo…

20:00.303 --> 20:01.471
We made it.

20:01.554 --> 20:04.307
Took long enough, gonkbrain.

20:05.808 --> 20:07.227
Shut the fuck up!

20:07.310 --> 20:10.355
Falco. Got a favor to ask you.

20:10.438 --> 20:12.315
Alright, time to retreat!

20:13.399 --> 20:14.984
Glad you're back safe.

20:16.319 --> 20:18.363
For David's sake, I mean.

20:21.574 --> 20:23.660
We're having a moment--

20:39.092 --> 20:40.510
Rebecca!

20:43.346 --> 20:44.472
Damn you…

20:52.522 --> 20:54.816
You have a Sandevistan?!

20:54.899 --> 20:56.943
It's a rudimentary implant.

20:57.026 --> 20:59.320
I'm the one you're after!

20:59.404 --> 21:03.616
All the same meat to me.
I'll slaughter each and every one of you.

21:03.700 --> 21:06.244
Not if I kill you first!

21:09.914 --> 21:12.166
Out of meds?

21:14.419 --> 21:17.213
Right on schedule, I'd say.

21:17.297 --> 21:18.339
David!

21:26.723 --> 21:27.807
What?!

21:30.601 --> 21:34.397
Falco… David's still back there…

21:34.480 --> 21:35.523
Falco!

21:35.606 --> 21:39.152
None leave the slaughterhouse alive.

21:40.236 --> 21:42.155
Distracted much?

21:42.238 --> 21:43.906
You…

21:43.990 --> 21:49.037
Who are you… to challenge me…

21:49.620 --> 21:53.791
When you can't even stand
without your antigrav crutches?

21:54.625 --> 21:57.795
Think you're special
'cause you're scrappy?

22:00.006 --> 22:02.383
Don't make me laugh!

22:06.012 --> 22:08.014
Falco! Turn back…

22:08.097 --> 22:08.931
No.

22:09.640 --> 22:11.559
David asked me.

22:12.143 --> 22:15.313
If I go back now…
he'd have died for nothing.

22:15.396 --> 22:18.316
I've got the commission money.

22:18.399 --> 22:21.069
He wants it split between us.

22:22.070 --> 22:24.072
He also told me to tell ya…

22:25.448 --> 22:29.077
Sorry. Wish we could go
to the moon together.

23:11.077 --> 23:13.746
I had fun after all.

23:14.330 --> 23:18.751
You know, you could prove
an interesting construct.

23:19.418 --> 23:23.381
Like I… give a shit…

23:24.340 --> 23:27.426
Alright. Well then.

23:56.747 --> 24:00.042
Welcome to the tour of the moon!

24:00.126 --> 24:05.381
Experience lunar gravity
like nothing you've seen on a BD…

24:26.402 --> 24:28.654
Whoa! Check this!

24:29.238 --> 24:31.407
I can feel the fucking sun!
